NOTE ON BUNDLED AND FETCHED COMPONENTS

This repository contains only build recipes and scripts. It redistributes no
third-party software.

- qdomyos-zwift (QZ) is GPL-3.0. It is fetched from source at build time. The
  patch applied to it lives in patches/ and is published here as GPL requires.
- TrainingPeaks Virtual is proprietary. It is NOT redistributed. The build
  downloads the official installer from virtual.trainingpeaks.com at build
  time, exactly as the user would themselves. Do not publish a built image.
- Wine, DXVK and VKD3D-Proton are fetched from their upstream releases under
  their own licences.
